{"chapter": "etale-cohomology", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "05BE", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$X$", "MATH_0002": "$\\Lambda$", "MATH_0003": "$\\Lambda$", "MATH_0004": "$X_\\etale$", "MATH_0005": "$\\Lambda$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-tensor-product-constructible}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:b9aecafd690ba062143f357cf1c0018f4d486f8ea2dbbbb00c43d51c98bcc63f", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:5401fed48e90e1ba114c7c3b6e5d19bbc795e6c25c31a3b1e586d2e845e17adc", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a scheme. Let <MATH_0002> be a Noetherian ring.\nThe tensor product of two constructible sheaves of <MATH_0003>-modules\non <MATH_0004> is a constructible sheaf of <MATH_0005>-modules.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:7743d34a33d635b4204d7ee520e17f80c851d5168104ed9807afe4df5160cbad", "unit_id": "tag:095I:statement"}
{"chapter": "etale-cohomology", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "05BE", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$X$", "MATH_0002": "$X$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{lemma-tensor-product-locally-constant}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:9651110046b3737a3aaba5f8ec6e85e5c672b54bb1c97d235ddf35facbbc4cf3", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:aff6a0e16b9befff4949e7d78193a86524c31c541705080cce12140d52b07626", "source_text": "The question immediately reduces to the case where <MATH_0001> is affine.\nSince any two partitions of <MATH_0002> with constructible locally\nclosed strata have a common refinement of the same type and\nsince pullbacks commute with tensor product we reduce to\nLemma <REF_0001>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:dc0dc273bec347571bb4e5537bb5edad2b1ccb6b98e415c6f0fbc19be8229ce4", "unit_id": "tag:095I:proof"}
{"chapter": "etale-cohomology", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "05BE", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$\\Lambda \\to \\Lambda'$", "MATH_0002": "$X$", "MATH_0003": "$\\mathcal{F}$", "MATH_0004": "$\\Lambda$", "MATH_0005": "$X_\\etale$", "MATH_0006": "$\\mathcal{F} \\otimes_{\\underline{\\Lambda}} \\underline{\\Lambda'}$", "MATH_0007": "$\\Lambda'$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-tensor-constructible}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:b32251ca24b93332a55cb20606312d624fdf043954f1bc6d0f2dd6e0b132ada7", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:b84f600a2c59da2092c3ed51bca4fd9feb966009eaaaa62e81f003c27320e64b", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a homomorphism of Noetherian rings.\nLet <MATH_0002> be a scheme. Let <MATH_0003> be a constructible\nsheaf of <MATH_0004>-modules on <MATH_0005>. Then\n<MATH_0006>\nis a constructible sheaf of <MATH_0007>-modules.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:d80f9a09973e657ee8f45a07e3780a763a79ac30188e75709d76a0ac923b9228", "unit_id": "tag:0GKB:statement"}
{"chapter": "etale-cohomology", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "05BE", "placeholders": {}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:7b1e3142b2f834e4a8e9d6f9f053a9527f6c84ed4a065a1f1537f2d6b6db72ad", "source_text": "Omitted. Hint: affine locally you can use the same stratification.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:40d44e96fc54ef0cdc0733693435b9b3e6e6ea588506b7ea776f9e775f648c64", "unit_id": "tag:0GKB:proof"}
